$gamePlayer.reserveTransfer($gameMap.mapId(), $gamePlayer.x, $gamePlayer.y, 0, 2);
This has unintended consequences of not preserving the map state and running any scripts you had run on map load again. It's worse than SceneManager.goto(Scene_Map)
